{
    "title": "PERFUMIST Perfumes Advisor",
    "description": "Discover the perfect fragrance with ease using PERFUMIST! \r\n\r\nPERFUMIST is the ultimate mobile app designed to help you find your ideal perfume or the perfect gift, all while saving you time on your next purchase. Explore new olfactory horizons through one of the largest fragrance libraries in the world, boasting a constantly expanding database of nearly 60,000 perfumes from over 2,400 different brands. From incredibly rare niche fragrances to popular bestsellers, we strive to gather information on every perfume in existence.\r\n\r\nWherever you are, at any time, PERFUMIST is your essential tool for discovering the right perfumes.\r\n\r\n- Browse our extensive perfume database of nearly 60,000 fragrances and explore their olfactory descriptions.\r\n- Create your personalized olfactory profile to uncover a tailored selection of fragrances just for you.\r\n- Search perfumes by notes, olfactive families, brands, new releases, or even by scanning barcodes.\r\n- Curate custom lists and gain an overview of your fragrance collection.\r\n- Discover perfume recommendations based on similar scents.\r\n- Share your favorite perfumes with your community and friends.\r\n- Explore nearby shops and discover the world of fragrance around you.\r\n\r\nBy using PERFUMIST, you become part of the largest community of perfume enthusiasts worldwide. Browse profiles of friends or follow individuals from around the globe who share your passion.\r\n\r\nAt PERFUMIST, we believe that everyone should have access to the best information when it comes to choosing or trying new perfumes. We believe that scent should be the primary factor in selecting a fragrance. Furthermore, we aim to educate consumers by upholding the highest perfume standards.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOUR MISSION\r\nOur mission is to bring more people to the world of perfumes and introduce a diverse range of fragrances to individuals worldwide.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOUR TEAM\r\nWe are a team of passionate individuals on a mission. We are 100% independent and encompass a cross-cultural background. We have no affiliations with any brands or retailers, and our sole purpose is to provide unbiased advice.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nPERFUMIST is made for and by our users. If you have any comments or suggestions for improvement, please contact us through the PERFUMIST app under the \"Contact Us\" section. For professional inquiries, please email us at contact@perfumist.fr.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover the perfect fragrance with ease using PERFUMIST! <br><br>PERFUMIST is the ultimate mobile app designed to help you find your ideal perfume or the perfect gift, all while saving you time on your next purchase. Explore new olfactory horizons through one of the largest fragrance libraries in the world, boasting a constantly expanding database of nearly 60,000 perfumes from over 2,400 different brands. From incredibly rare niche fragrances to popular bestsellers, we strive to gather information on every perfume in existence.<br><br>Wherever you are, at any time, PERFUMIST is your essential tool for discovering the right perfumes.<br><br>- Browse our extensive perfume database of nearly 60,000 fragrances and explore their olfactory descriptions.<br>- Create your personalized olfactory profile to uncover a tailored selection of fragrances just for you.<br>- Search perfumes by notes, olfactive families, brands, new releases, or even by scanning barcodes.<br>- Curate custom lists and gain an overview of your fragrance collection.<br>- Discover perfume recommendations based on similar scents.<br>- Share your favorite perfumes with your community and friends.<br>- Explore nearby shops and discover the world of fragrance around you.<br><br>By using PERFUMIST, you become part of the largest community of perfume enthusiasts worldwide. Browse profiles of friends or follow individuals from around the globe who share your passion.<br><br>At PERFUMIST, we believe that everyone should have access to the best information when it comes to choosing or trying new perfumes. We believe that scent should be the primary factor in selecting a fragrance. Furthermore, we aim to educate consumers by upholding the highest perfume standards.<br><br>---<br><br>OUR MISSION<br>Our mission is to bring more people to the world of perfumes and introduce a diverse range of fragrances to individuals worldwide.<br><br>---<br><br>OUR TEAM<br>We are a team of passionate individuals on a mission. We are 100% independent and encompass a cross-cultural background. We have no affiliations with any brands or retailers, and our sole purpose is to provide unbiased advice.<br><br>---<br><br>PERFUMIST is made for and by our users. If you have any comments or suggestions for improvement, please contact us through the PERFUMIST app under the &quot;Contact Us&quot; section. For professional inquiries, please email us at contact@perfumist.fr.",
